The {{Term/Store|Of Twilight Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Hero of Twilight Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 193"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Hero of Twilight Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Cap of Twilight]], [[Tunic of Twilight]], and [[Trousers of Twilight]]. All three pieces can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SSB}} [[Link]] [[amiibo]] or {{TP}} Link amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear which has a small chance of containing one of the pieces. As the amiibo can only be scanned once per real-world day, the Armor Set must be collected over the course of three or more real-world days. 

The Hero of Twilight Set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the [[Master Sword]] Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set. It resembles Link's outfit from {{TP|-}}.  

